    "description": "This NCEI accession consists of the discrete measurements of temperature, salinity, dissolved inorganic carbon (DIC) and total alkalinity (TALK) collected during the multiple ships Observatoire de la variabilit\u00c3\u00a9 interannuelle et d\u00c3\u00a9cennale en Atlantique Nord (OVIDE) project, OVIDE-2006, OVIDE-2008, OVIDE-2010, OVIDE-2012, OVIDE-2014 cruises in the North Atlantic Ocean from 2006-05-23 to 2014-06-30 and measured back at LOCEAN laboratory. These measurements are complementary of the OVIDE cruise data (available in GLODAP-v2) and SURATLANT dataset.",
